          "thread": "Private credit and RWA rate arbitrage",
          "why": "Rising TradFi rates drove companies to blockchain-based private credit (55% sector surge) and tokenized Treasuries (ONDO), while simultaneously stressing funds that had lent at locked rates, creating both opportunity and withdrawal pressure."
